id: og_quarry
name: Quarry
description: Quarry. Benches cut down into rock, each wider than the one above it, so from the rim you can see every level you are about to stand on and from the floor you can see none of them. Built as a stone quarry with a haul road; the face was shot the week the site closed and the muck was never cleared.

